'''Conjoined''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', grows two tumor faces from Isaac's cheeks after picking up 3 baby familiar items.

== Effects ==
* Isaac fires tears from the tumor faces simultaneously and diagonally (similar to the effect of {{i|The Wiz}}), while continuing to shoot forwards.
* -0.3 [[damage]] and [[tears]].

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags baby|{{code|baby}} tag]]).

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{Collectible table/header}}
{{collectible rows | Brother Bobby, Harlequin Baby, Headless Baby, Little Steven, Mongo Baby, Rotten Baby, Sister Maggy }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r | Abel, Acid Baby, Boiled Baby, Buddy in a Box, Cube Baby, Demon Baby, Dry Baby, Farting Baby, Freezer Baby, Ghost Baby, Guardian Angel, Incubus, King Baby, Lil Abaddon, Lil Brimstone, Lil Loki, Multidimensional Baby, Quints, Rainbow Baby, Robo-Baby, Robo-Baby 2.0, Seraphim, Sworn Protector, Twisted Pair }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r+ | Lil Delirium }}
|}

== Notes ==
* Isaac starts with this transformation in [[The Family Man]] challenge, but due to the challenge's [[blindfolded]] property, it's useless without {{i|Incubus}}.
* {{I|Little Gish}}, {{i|Lil Monstro}}, {{I|Lil Delirium|nr+}}, and {{c|Lilith}}'s {{i|Incubus}} do not contribute toward the transformation.
* Familiars obtained from {{i|Cambion Conception}}, {{I|Immaculate Conception}} or {{I|Monster Manual}} do not contribute toward the transformation.
* {{dlc+|r}} Familiars obtained from {{P|Soul of Lilith|n}} contribute toward the transformation.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} Using {{I|Sacrificial Altar}} can remove Conjoined if it lowers the number of familiars below 3.{{dlc-}}

